# Vulnerabilities the publish workflow's Trivy gate may skip.
#
# The gate fails a build on any fixable CRITICAL or HIGH finding. A finding is
# waived here only when it does not apply to this image or cannot be fixed yet,
# and only until a stated date. One waiver per entry, in this format:
#
#   # <reason it is waived>; expires YYYY-MM-DD
#   <vulnerability ID, for example CVE-2026-12345>
#
# Remove the entry on or before its expiry date, or renew it with a new reason.
# Trivy does not read the expiry: it is a reminder for whoever reviews this file.
# There are no waivers at present.
